    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A relic of the prior war, Monk was once an honorable general and a mighty
    warrior.



    Tales of his feats were surreal until you met him on the battlefield.
    With each battle, his fame and wealth grew. He was considered the greatest warrior
    in the nation for a time, that was until he encountered Fraug. In one decisive
    stroke, Monk was defeated and, in the process, lost his arm.



    With his
    pride as a warrior lost, Monk resigned from his position and recused himself
    into the mountains. For three straight years, Monk trained tirelessly until he
    could one day wield his sword normally again.



    Now he roams the land, searching
    for Fraug to challenge him once again for the title of greatest warrior.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 588261a4840a0cf4e808cf1057fa2945, type: 2}
